## solution

#### using two pointers

```javascript
const fiveSort = (nums) => {
  let i = 0;
  let j = nums.length - 1;
  while (i < j) {
    if (nums[j] === 5) {
      j -= 1;
    } else if (nums[i] === 5) {
      [ nums[i], nums[j] ] = [ nums[j], nums[i] ];
      i += 1;
    } else {
      i += 1;
    }
  }

  return nums;
};
```

- n = array size
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)

